# ==============================================================================
# WSU Workshop: Husky Pre-Commit Git Hook
# ==============================================================================
# Git hooks are scripts triggered automatically before or after Git events.
# The 'pre-commit' hook runs locally when a developer types 'git commit'.
#
# If any command fails (exit code != 0), the commit is aborted.
# 1. lint-staged: Formats and lints only files currently staged for commit.
# 2. typecheck: Ensures full project TypeScript compilation passes before committing.
# ==============================================================================

npx lint-staged
npm run typecheck
